<%#
# What the edit form of an account was drawn from

One hidden token per section (SuperAdmin::AccountFormState). The update refuses to save a section whose token no longer
matches the account: somebody else changed it while the form was open.

## Local variables:

- `account`: the account (Account).
%>
<% SuperAdmin::AccountFormState.tokens_for(account, params[:form_state]).each do |section, token| %>
  <%= hidden_field_tag "form_state[#{section}]", token, id: nil %>
<% end %>
